  "normalization_rules": {
    "scope": "Every create of the automatic first migration and of the R4 explicit copy, identical on iOS and Android; the originals stay unchanged in the local archive. A vector names its platform when its input uses platform units or fields; without platform it holds on both.",
    "input": "kind task|list; title; description (null or string); due_at, created_at, completed_at in Unix seconds on iOS, due_at_ms, created_at_ms, completed_at_ms in milliseconds on Android; now = the estimated server time in Unix seconds; is_completed; priority; sort_order (iOS only); index = the row's 0-based position among its siblings in the platform's local order (folders among folders, tasks within their folder); local_id of a folder; assignee {peer_id = iOS PeerId.toInt64(), display_name} (iOS only). An absent field is null, false or 0.",
    "expected": "Wire values of the create (list.create, or task.create with its content flattened) for the listed fields only. cloud_inbox true means no list.create: the folder is the virtual Cloud Inbox and its tasks carry list_id null.",
    "edge_whitespace": "U+0009..U+000D, U+0085 and the categories Zs, Zl, Zp (x-permissions-and-state.visible_text)",
    "visible_scalar": "a scalar outside the categories Cc, Cf, Mn, Mc, Me, Zs, Zl, Zp",
    "truncate": "truncate(s, L, B) = s when s has at most L scalars and B UTF-8 bytes; otherwise the longest prefix of s that ends on an extended-grapheme boundary of the platform and has at most L - 1 scalars and B - 3 bytes, followed by U+2026. Counting scalars keeps the server's grapheme count within L whatever its ICU version.",
    "list_title": "trim edge whitespace; no visible scalar left -> the placeholder tasks_migration_importedList of the record locale; then truncate(title, 100, 8192)",
    "task_title": "trim edge whitespace; no visible scalar left -> the placeholder tasks_migration_untitledTask of the record locale; then truncate(title, 200, 8192). When truncate shortened the title, the description becomes the trimmed full title (no description) or the trimmed full title + \"\\n\\n\" + the normalized description, if that has at most 4096 scalars and 16384 bytes; otherwise the normalized description stays",
    "description": "\"\" -> null; truncate(description, 4096, 16384); no edge rule (trailing whitespace stays)",
    "due_at": "iOS seconds; Android milliseconds floored to seconds. Negative, above 2147483647 and, on Android, 0 (the local schema requires > 0) -> null",
    "created_at": "negative or later than now + 300 s -> null (the server stamps its own time); else the Instant",
    "completed_at": "null when the task is not completed; for a completed task an invalid time (as created_at) -> null (unknown)",
    "priority": "clamped to 0..4",
    "sort_order": "lists and tasks: iOS keeps a value that fits Int32; any other value, and every Android row, -> index * 1024",
    "annotation": "always null: the iOS assignee stays on the device in the archive (a Telegram contact is never sent automatically); Android has no assignee",
    "inbox": "iOS sgtasks.inbox whose stored title is exactly one of inbox_titles, and Android inbox, map to the virtual Cloud Inbox; a renamed iOS inbox and every other folder become a real list",
    "inbox_titles": ["Inbox", "Kiruvchi", "Входящие"],
    "placeholders": {
      "tasks_migration_untitledTask": {"en": "Untitled task", "uz": "Nomsiz vazifa", "ru": "Задача без названия"},
      "tasks_migration_importedList": {
        "en": "Imported list",
        "uz": "Import qilingan roʻyxat",
        "ru": "Импортированный список"
      }
    },
    "segmentation": "Expected values assume extended grapheme clusters of Unicode 11 or later (Swift, ICU 62+, JDK 20+). N13a cuts between whole ZWJ families; an older segmenter may cut elsewhere and still meet the server bound. N13b is the same on every segmenter."
  },
  "normalization": [
    {
      "id": "N1a",
      "case": "task title: edge whitespace trimmed",
      "input": {"kind": "task", "title": "  Ish "},
      "locale": "en",
      "expected": {"title": "Ish"}
    },
    {
      "id": "N1b",
      "case": "task title: control and no-break space edges trimmed",
